<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n101448" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συστά̆τ-ης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span>,
			ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>organizer, creator</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν κατὰ
				φιλοσοφίαν τεχνῶν</span>, of Protagoras, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				<u>Phil.Hist.</u>
				3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>delegate of appointments</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. τῆς μελλούσης λειτουργεῖν φυλῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PFlor.</u>
					39.4
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iv A.D.)</span>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				1116
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iv A.D.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PSI</u>
				10.1108
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iv A.D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> pl., <i>pairs</i> of young men <i>matched</i> for
			wrestling and other games, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φίλοι καὶ
			ς</span>. <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.2023
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				2024
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b> pl.,
				<i>rafters of the roof which meet at the top</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ath.Mech.
				17.10
			</span></i>, al., Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				23.711
			</span></i>: sg., <u>Gloss.</u>
        </div>
